WEBVTT

00:00:00.480 --> 00:00:04.400
Keep on holding me

00:00:00.480 --> 00:00:04.400
Daite ite mune de anata no koe wo kiite iru

00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:09.280
I listen to your voice in your arms

00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:09.280
Daite ite mune de anata no koe wo kiite iru

00:00:10.940 --> 00:00:22.080
If I reach out in the light, I can touch

00:00:10.940 --> 00:00:22.080
Hikari no naka ni te wo sashinobaseba todoku

00:00:22.710 --> 00:00:27.250
The precious arms

00:00:22.710 --> 00:00:27.250
Anna ni motomete ita kakegae no nai ude e

00:00:27.250 --> 00:00:32.260
I have been searching for so hard

00:00:27.250 --> 00:00:32.260
Anna ni motomete ita kakegae no nai ude e

00:00:33.130 --> 00:00:39.600
I turn around and the sky of blue

00:00:33.130 --> 00:00:39.600
Furimukeba kodoku ni wa

00:00:40.430 --> 00:00:49.070
Smiles down upon my solitude

00:00:40.430 --> 00:00:49.070
Sora ga aoku hohoende kureru

00:00:49.270 --> 00:00:56.320
In the darkness, I nearly lose sight of my dreams

00:00:49.270 --> 00:00:56.320
Kurayami ni yume wo miushinai sou ni naru

00:00:56.860 --> 00:01:04.250
But if you remain by my side

00:00:56.860 --> 00:01:04.250
Demo anata ga itekureru no nara

00:01:04.790 --> 00:01:08.540
Keep on holding me

00:01:04.790 --> 00:01:08.540
Daite ite mune de anata no koe wo kiite iru

00:01:08.540 --> 00:01:12.210
I listen to your voice in your arms

00:01:08.540 --> 00:01:12.210
Daite ite mune de anata no koe wo kiite iru

00:01:12.210 --> 00:01:19.390
I want to protect this love for always

00:01:12.210 --> 00:01:19.390
Itsudemo kono omoi wo mamoritai no

00:01:19.640 --> 00:01:24.730
This love...

00:01:19.640 --> 00:01:24.730
Omoi wo

00:02:02.060 --> 00:02:03.060
Morning.

00:02:03.390 --> 00:02:04.020
Kurau...

00:02:05.180 --> 00:02:06.850
Is it okay for you to get up?

00:02:07.310 --> 00:02:08.850
Are you feeling all right?

00:02:08.850 --> 00:02:11.860
Yeah, I feel kind of good.

00:02:12.690 --> 00:02:14.820
I owe it all to you, Christmas.

00:02:20.530 --> 00:02:22.030
What a beautiful day!

00:02:22.030 --> 00:02:27.370
Yeah! But the forecast said it might
start raining this evening.

00:02:27.370 --> 00:02:30.750
I wonder if the laundry will dry by then.

00:02:32.170 --> 00:02:33.130
Rain...

00:02:34.460 --> 00:02:35.630
Really...

00:02:36.260 --> 00:02:37.840
Even though it's so sunny now...

00:02:45.350 --> 00:02:47.390
What's going to happen now?

00:02:47.390 --> 00:02:49.310
Kurau? What's wrong?

00:02:56.570 --> 00:02:58.950
We don't have an umbrella yet, do we?

00:02:58.950 --> 00:03:00.910
Let's pick one up on our walk.

00:03:00.910 --> 00:03:02.870
Walk?! Yay!

00:03:02.870 --> 00:03:05.450
There's a place I want to show you, Kurau.

00:03:05.450 --> 00:03:07.200
Really? Where?

00:03:09.120 --> 00:03:13.080
Glowing Rain

00:03:16.380 --> 00:03:18.970
I found this place while
I was out shopping yesterday.

00:03:18.970 --> 00:03:22.140
I thought you might like it.

00:03:24.350 --> 00:03:26.560
Yeah, I like it.

00:03:26.560 --> 00:03:27.680
See!

00:03:35.110 --> 00:03:37.110
This is a beautiful city, isn't it...

00:03:37.110 --> 00:03:38.150
Yeah...

00:03:39.440 --> 00:03:42.160
I wonder how long we'll be able to stay here...

00:03:42.570 --> 00:03:44.740
Are we going somewhere again?

00:03:46.870 --> 00:03:49.200
Do you like this city, Christmas?

00:03:53.420 --> 00:03:54.960
About yesterday...

00:03:54.960 --> 00:03:59.710
If GPO finds out that we're Rynax,
we won't be able to stay here either...

00:04:04.590 --> 00:04:06.470
Hey, stop that!

00:04:07.220 --> 00:04:09.470
You know, Christmas...

00:04:09.470 --> 00:04:14.690
I've always used the power of Rynax...

00:04:14.690 --> 00:04:17.610
That was what came naturally for me.

00:04:18.270 --> 00:04:19.570
But...

00:04:20.780 --> 00:04:22.030
Cut that out!

00:04:32.460 --> 00:04:37.420
I'm planting these so that this city and
its children will have a happy future.

00:04:37.420 --> 00:04:39.590
Would you like to plant some too?

00:04:42.050 --> 00:04:43.380
Hey, Kurau.

00:04:43.380 --> 00:04:48.350
Wherever we go, I'm sure we'll be able to find a place we'll like.

00:04:48.850 --> 00:04:49.720
Yeah...

00:04:56.480 --> 00:04:57.520
Who is it?

00:04:58.150 --> 00:04:59.440
Carradine?

00:05:00.070 --> 00:05:01.360
What?!

00:05:02.570 --> 00:05:03.740
Lunch?

00:05:04.240 --> 00:05:05.780
Lunch?

00:05:09.660 --> 00:05:12.330
Here! Eat all you want!

00:05:12.330 --> 00:05:13.870
Come on, don't be shy!

00:05:13.870 --> 00:05:15.960
What's come over you?

00:05:15.960 --> 00:05:20.960
What's that look for? Is it so bad that I take you out to lunch?

00:05:20.960 --> 00:05:23.170
I've been your partner for many years now,

00:05:23.170 --> 00:05:25.010
but this is the first time you've treated me.

00:05:25.630 --> 00:05:27.300
If you gotta problem with it, then don't eat!

00:05:27.300 --> 00:05:29.300
Well then, shall we eat?

00:05:29.640 --> 00:05:30.720
Let me serve you.

00:05:30.720 --> 00:05:32.390
Oh, thank you!

00:05:32.390 --> 00:05:35.940
Oh yeah, the boiled dumpling here is the best!

00:05:35.940 --> 00:05:39.480
Kurau's little sister, um...
the one with the unusual name...

00:05:39.480 --> 00:05:41.610
Christmas. She's a little nervous.

00:05:42.070 --> 00:05:43.730
There's nothing to be nervous about!

00:05:43.730 --> 00:05:46.990
Yup, the boiled dumpling here is excellent!

00:05:46.990 --> 00:05:49.990
Hey, Sam. Say something, will ya?

00:05:49.990 --> 00:05:54.000
I'm not used to talking to girls.

00:05:54.000 --> 00:05:56.500
There's no reason for you to be nervous!

00:05:58.500 --> 00:05:59.790
It's good!

00:05:59.790 --> 00:06:01.840
I've never had this before. it's delicious!

00:06:02.630 --> 00:06:06.470
Oh yeah? That's great! I'm glad!

00:06:06.920 --> 00:06:09.800
Uh... what do I say now?

00:06:09.800 --> 00:06:11.140
Why don't you just shut up?

00:06:12.350 --> 00:06:15.520
You got me there!

00:06:17.140 --> 00:06:20.060
If I don't keep talking, I get nervous!

00:06:27.070 --> 00:06:30.240
Thanks, Carradine... For inviting Christmas, too.

00:06:30.240 --> 00:06:33.330
No problem. Oh, I almost forgot.

00:06:33.330 --> 00:06:35.540
I wanted you to deliver this.

00:06:35.540 --> 00:06:37.250
Do you have time right now?

00:06:37.250 --> 00:06:38.290
What is it?

00:06:38.290 --> 00:06:41.000
It's an easy job. All you have to do is deliver it.

00:06:42.080 --> 00:06:44.550
It's light. What's in here?

00:06:44.550 --> 00:06:46.420
Just some documents.

00:06:46.420 --> 00:06:48.630
My client wishes to be inconspicuous,

00:06:48.630 --> 00:06:51.260
so the designated delivery location
will be in the mountains...

00:06:51.260 --> 00:06:52.470
it's right here.

00:06:52.600 --> 00:06:54.850
A resort hotel is currently being constructed here,

00:06:54.850 --> 00:06:57.310
but they're taking a break and
no one will be around.

00:06:57.310 --> 00:06:59.810
Meet at this courtyard at 4:00.

00:06:59.810 --> 00:07:01.350
What's our client like?

00:07:01.350 --> 00:07:03.270
You'll find out when you get there.

00:07:03.440 --> 00:07:05.270
Will you do the job?

00:07:05.270 --> 00:07:07.940
Sure. I just have to deliver it, right?

00:07:07.940 --> 00:07:09.950
Hey! You ready?

00:07:09.950 --> 00:07:12.320
Yeah, I'm done.

00:07:14.330 --> 00:07:18.040
Um, Mr. Carradine. I had so much fun.

00:07:18.040 --> 00:07:19.120
Thank you!

00:07:19.540 --> 00:07:20.580
No problem...

00:07:20.580 --> 00:07:22.290
Here, this is to thank you.

00:07:22.290 --> 00:07:24.170
Th-That's okay, don't worry about it.

00:07:24.170 --> 00:07:25.500
You should take it.

00:07:25.500 --> 00:07:26.670
Come on...

00:07:26.670 --> 00:07:29.630
They said it might rain.

00:07:30.630 --> 00:07:32.050
In that case...

00:07:35.760 --> 00:07:38.930
Okay, see you later. Thanks for lunch!

00:07:51.990 --> 00:07:55.570
I shouldn't have had lunch with them...

00:07:57.700 --> 00:08:01.330
He asked me to do a job.
Can you go home by yourself?

00:08:01.330 --> 00:08:02.290
Yup.

00:08:02.290 --> 00:08:04.880
I won't be long, so we can have dinner together.

00:08:04.880 --> 00:08:06.750
Okay, I'll wait for you.

00:08:06.960 --> 00:08:08.420
Are you sure you'll be okay?

00:08:08.420 --> 00:08:09.920
I'll be fine.

00:08:11.010 --> 00:08:12.590
What about you?

00:08:12.590 --> 00:08:16.050
I'm fine now. it's an easy job.

00:08:16.050 --> 00:08:17.300
Easy.

00:08:17.300 --> 00:08:19.220
Okay now, go on home.

00:08:19.220 --> 00:08:20.220
Okay.

00:08:54.090 --> 00:08:55.130
Oh!

00:08:55.130 --> 00:08:59.310
I should've given this to Kurau!

00:09:08.980 --> 00:09:10.440
Are you alone?

00:09:12.690 --> 00:09:14.110
It's the liar!

00:09:14.110 --> 00:09:17.740
L-I'm not! I came to help you two.

00:09:17.740 --> 00:09:18.700
Help us?

00:09:18.700 --> 00:09:21.580
That's right. Where's your older sister?

00:09:21.580 --> 00:09:23.450
What sister?

00:09:23.450 --> 00:09:26.250
She's not your older sister?

00:09:26.250 --> 00:09:28.920
You're the bad man who's after Kurau, right?

00:09:28.920 --> 00:09:32.380
No, I'm not. I'm an Agent.
You know what that is, right?

00:09:32.380 --> 00:09:34.300
I'm like your sister.

00:09:34.300 --> 00:09:36.510
If you want, I can show you my ID.

00:09:36.510 --> 00:09:38.800
So you're like Sam and Carradine?

00:09:38.800 --> 00:09:43.060
That's right. My job is to help you two.

00:09:43.060 --> 00:09:44.390
How come?

00:09:44.390 --> 00:09:46.640
Bad guys are after you, right?

00:09:48.940 --> 00:09:51.440
Will you listen to what I have to say?

00:09:55.440 --> 00:09:57.820
I'm Doug. What's your name?

00:09:58.240 --> 00:09:59.570
Christmas.

00:09:59.570 --> 00:10:01.160
Christmas...

00:10:01.160 --> 00:10:02.830
That's a nice name.

00:10:29.480 --> 00:10:33.480
So why are the bad guys after your sister?

00:10:34.940 --> 00:10:36.240
I don't know.

00:10:37.280 --> 00:10:39.070
You don't know, huh?

00:10:39.990 --> 00:10:42.200
But you know, Christmas...

00:10:42.200 --> 00:10:46.580
The bad guys you're talking about are the GPO.

00:10:46.950 --> 00:10:51.830
GPO usually catches the bad guys.
You understand?

00:10:51.830 --> 00:10:53.090
It's the other way around.

00:10:53.090 --> 00:10:55.630
Kurau hasn't done anything wrong!

00:10:55.630 --> 00:10:57.880
Yeah, I know! I know.

00:10:57.880 --> 00:11:00.430
Calm down! Calm down!

00:11:05.680 --> 00:11:09.560
You two are caught up in some kind of
unexplainable circumstances.

00:11:14.060 --> 00:11:16.230
Hello? Teddy?

00:11:16.230 --> 00:11:17.690
I'm working right now.

00:11:17.690 --> 00:11:19.740
Okay, I'll call you back later.

00:11:19.740 --> 00:11:20.950
Sorry.

00:11:22.910 --> 00:11:23.950
Who was that?

00:11:23.950 --> 00:11:28.870
Oh, that? That was my son, Teddy.

00:11:28.870 --> 00:11:30.120
See?

00:11:31.170 --> 00:11:34.420
Wow, he's cute.

00:11:34.920 --> 00:11:37.710
He'd be mad if he heard that.

00:11:37.710 --> 00:11:40.260
He prefers "cool" now.

00:11:42.890 --> 00:11:45.050
So you're a father?

00:11:45.640 --> 00:11:47.390
Yeah, that's right.

00:11:47.850 --> 00:11:52.140
I don't live with him right now,
but he's my precious son.

00:11:52.810 --> 00:11:55.020
Precious...

00:11:56.270 --> 00:11:59.740
To me, Kurau is precious.

00:11:59.740 --> 00:12:01.820
I see...

00:12:22.550 --> 00:12:26.100
A sunshower! How pretty!

00:12:26.350 --> 00:12:28.850
I wish Christmas could see it!

00:12:30.850 --> 00:12:32.600
I want to meet Ted.

00:12:33.560 --> 00:12:36.400
Yeah, you could be his friend.

00:12:36.400 --> 00:12:37.190
Sure!

00:12:38.690 --> 00:12:42.490
I had a great time talking with you, Christmas.

00:12:43.200 --> 00:12:46.320
But we don't have much time.

00:12:46.870 --> 00:12:49.030
Where did Kurau go?

00:12:49.620 --> 00:12:51.410
I don't know...

00:12:51.410 --> 00:12:54.160
But she said we'd have dinner together tonight.

00:12:54.160 --> 00:12:55.710
I see...

00:12:56.330 --> 00:13:00.880
I want to take you two to another city as soon as possible.

00:13:03.260 --> 00:13:05.340
Kurau said that too...

00:13:05.680 --> 00:13:08.140
That we may not be able to stay here.

00:13:28.070 --> 00:13:29.950
Did I get here too early?

00:13:48.220 --> 00:13:49.600
What on Earth...

00:13:52.560 --> 00:13:54.930
What's the GPO doing here?!

00:13:59.900 --> 00:14:01.270
Empty...

00:14:02.520 --> 00:14:05.570
Carradine... Why?

00:14:23.380 --> 00:14:25.880
AR System Irradiation complete.

00:14:25.880 --> 00:14:27.800
Target is not moving.

00:14:27.800 --> 00:14:31.180
Shield is holding up. Standing by.

00:14:31.550 --> 00:14:33.430
No change in target.

00:14:33.430 --> 00:14:35.430
Group B, what's the situation?

00:14:35.430 --> 00:14:38.020
Have not confirmed second target.

00:14:38.020 --> 00:14:41.270
Keep standing by. Prepare for target's return.

00:14:41.480 --> 00:14:42.400
Roger.

00:14:42.400 --> 00:14:44.940
Group A, prepare transportation cage.

00:14:44.940 --> 00:14:45.650
Wait.

00:14:47.190 --> 00:14:50.700
How can that be?! The AR system didn't work?!

00:14:50.700 --> 00:14:51.490
What's going on?!

00:14:51.490 --> 00:14:52.870
I-I don't know.

00:14:52.870 --> 00:14:54.490
Irradiate one more time!

00:14:54.490 --> 00:14:56.950
It's still charging. it'll be 90 more seconds!

00:14:56.950 --> 00:14:59.120
Increase the shield power to maximum.

00:15:08.050 --> 00:15:11.340
G-Generator overload! it's not going to hold!

00:15:11.340 --> 00:15:12.970
She's breaking the shield!

00:15:15.890 --> 00:15:17.640
That's impossible.

00:15:17.640 --> 00:15:21.810
She... She isn't a Ryna sapien?!

00:15:22.900 --> 00:15:24.150
Charging complete!

00:15:24.150 --> 00:15:25.570
Number 2, irradiate!

00:15:37.370 --> 00:15:40.250
AR System numbers 2 and 3 taken out!

00:15:40.250 --> 00:15:41.670
Get the relief team here quickly!

00:15:41.670 --> 00:15:42.920
She's flying again!

00:15:42.920 --> 00:15:44.750
Pod team, secure the sky.

00:15:44.750 --> 00:15:45.880
Don't let her escape!

00:16:18.790 --> 00:16:19.870
No!

00:16:27.130 --> 00:16:30.090
Why? Why is this happening?

00:16:36.010 --> 00:16:37.050
It's raining...

00:16:39.720 --> 00:16:41.140
Something's happened...

00:16:41.770 --> 00:16:42.810
To Kurau...

00:16:42.810 --> 00:16:44.060
To Kurau?

00:16:44.600 --> 00:16:45.980
What am I going to do?

00:16:45.980 --> 00:16:48.480
How do you know?

00:16:48.480 --> 00:16:52.190
Because Kurau and I are a Pair.

00:16:52.190 --> 00:16:54.780
A Pair? What do you mean?

00:16:55.910 --> 00:16:57.280
What am I going to do?

00:17:02.700 --> 00:17:05.580
I-Inspector! If we don't do something...

00:17:05.580 --> 00:17:07.960
Who knew she was this powerful...

00:17:08.710 --> 00:17:10.800
Stop, Ayaka. A gun won't work on her!

00:17:10.800 --> 00:17:12.300
But I can't let her escape.

00:17:13.630 --> 00:17:14.630
Kurau...

00:17:16.090 --> 00:17:26.440
Nanika mado kara hairikomisoude
Something seems about to enter through the window

00:17:20.760 --> 00:17:24.180
Crying? Why would she be crying?

00:17:27.440 --> 00:17:28.690
Disappearing...

00:17:28.690 --> 00:17:29.940
She's disappeared...

00:17:31.150 --> 00:17:32.440
Let's withdraw.

00:17:33.070 --> 00:17:35.030
The operation has failed.

00:17:36.530 --> 00:17:46.960
Kiniro ni ukabinagara Sora ni mukatte
In a golden glow, toward the sky...

00:17:38.450 --> 00:17:41.790
Christmas... Help me...

00:17:43.000 --> 00:17:44.450
Christmas...

00:17:45.160 --> 00:17:46.500
Where do you think you're going?

00:17:46.500 --> 00:17:48.670
You can't go home. it's too dangerous.

00:17:48.670 --> 00:17:51.710
She's calling! I have to go help Kurau!

00:17:50.380 --> 00:17:53.710
Tobu 
It flies

00:17:52.170 --> 00:17:53.840
Hey, wait!

00:17:54.590 --> 00:18:02.390
Mousugu shiroi asa ga kuru
Soon, the white dawn will come

00:17:58.300 --> 00:18:00.180
You know, Christmas...

00:18:01.390 --> 00:18:03.100
Why?

00:18:05.390 --> 00:18:06.940
Kurau...

00:18:08.350 --> 00:18:13.730
I've always used the power of Rynax...

00:18:10.110 --> 00:18:25.580
Ai wo makura ni korogatte ikiru 
Rolling along, pillowed by love, it lives

00:18:13.730 --> 00:18:17.070
That was what came naturally for me.

00:18:18.110 --> 00:18:18.910
But...

00:18:20.370 --> 00:18:25.580
Because I'm... Rynax? Is that why?

00:18:28.170 --> 00:18:29.250
Christmas...

00:18:30.500 --> 00:18:35.510
Motomete ita yume wa nani
What kind of dream was I searching for?

00:18:38.550 --> 00:18:46.100
Sora ni mukatte tou 
I look at the sky and ask the question

00:18:38.880 --> 00:18:40.260
Light?!

00:18:44.770 --> 00:18:46.100
Kurau!

00:18:46.680 --> 00:18:49.060
Kurau! Kurau!

00:18:48.600 --> 00:18:57.150
Jiyuu dakeredo kodoku wa iya
I am free but I don't want to be lonely

00:18:50.100 --> 00:18:52.150
Hey! What can you see?

00:18:57.150 --> 00:19:06.620
Lonely Freedom

00:18:58.570 --> 00:19:00.320
Kurau!

00:19:07.410 --> 00:19:17.050
Lonely Freedom

00:19:11.580 --> 00:19:13.040
Christmas...

00:19:13.880 --> 00:19:15.130
Kurau!

00:19:15.420 --> 00:19:16.670
Kurau!

00:19:17.710 --> 00:19:27.220
Lonely Freedom

00:19:28.020 --> 00:19:37.480
Lonely Freedom

00:19:38.400 --> 00:19:47.870
Lonely Freedom

00:19:39.400 --> 00:19:41.570
From... inside of me?

00:19:41.740 --> 00:19:45.240
This light... What is it?

00:19:47.830 --> 00:19:50.250
No! Don't make Kurau suffer!

00:19:48.750 --> 00:19:58.210
Lonely Freedom

00:19:50.370 --> 00:19:51.710
Go back!

00:19:51.710 --> 00:19:53.580
Go back to where you came from!

00:20:00.420 --> 00:20:05.680
Yume no iriguchi
The entrance of the dream

00:20:02.930 --> 00:20:07.810
That's right. You have the power too...

00:20:05.680 --> 00:20:10.770
Tooku de kimi ga 
You are smiling in the distance

00:20:07.810 --> 00:20:09.390
Of course...

00:20:09.890 --> 00:20:15.020
You and I are both Rynax..

00:20:17.440 --> 00:20:18.650
Kurau!

00:20:21.780 --> 00:20:22.950
Kurau...

00:20:25.240 --> 00:20:28.030
What... should I do?

00:20:28.990 --> 00:20:31.870
Where... should I go?

00:20:33.540 --> 00:20:34.670
Kurau...

00:20:42.550 --> 00:20:46.720
Kurau... I'll protect you.

00:20:47.550 --> 00:20:50.850
Just like you protect me.

00:20:50.850 --> 00:20:54.520
I want to protect you.

00:21:39.940 --> 00:21:46.910
From a great distance

00:21:39.940 --> 00:21:46.910
Tooku haruka kanata kara

00:21:49.280 --> 00:21:56.250
You smile at me

00:21:49.280 --> 00:21:56.250
Kimi ga hohoemu you ni

00:21:58.420 --> 00:22:05.380
The hopelessness that lingers from the past

00:21:58.420 --> 00:22:05.380
Kako kara tsuzuku hakanasa

00:22:07.510 --> 00:22:14.470
Is depicted in silence

00:22:07.510 --> 00:22:14.470
Shizuka ni utsushi dasarete

00:22:16.770 --> 00:22:23.730
Moonlight, please never change

00:22:16.770 --> 00:22:23.730
Moonlight kawarazu ni ite

00:22:25.860 --> 00:22:32.830
Moonlight, I'll come to see you

00:22:25.860 --> 00:22:32.830
Moonlight ai ni yuku Kimi ni

00:22:35.000 --> 00:22:41.960
Moonlight, I'll come running up and surely

00:22:35.000 --> 00:22:41.960
Moonlight kakenobori kitto

00:22:44.130 --> 00:22:51.090
Moonlight, we'll be able to meet again

00:22:44.130 --> 00:22:51.090
Moonlight mou ichido aeru

00:22:53.310 --> 00:23:00.270
Moonlight

00:22:53.310 --> 00:23:00.270
Moonlight

